<title>PHILIPPINES: SEC okays DMCI stock div, sets record date.</title>
<headline>SEC okays DMCI stock div, sets record date.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) approved the 100 percent stock dividend declaration of DMCI Holdings Inc and set the record date on June 18, the construction company said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The ex-dividend date is on June 6.</p>
<p>The SEC also approved the increase in DMCI's authorised capital stock to six billion pesos from 1.75 billion.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
